text:
O eternal God! Father, Son, and Holy Ghost;
the beginning and end of all things;
in whom we live and move and have our being;
prostrate before Thee in body and soul, I adore Thee.
I bless Thee and give Thee thanks.
What return can I make to Thee, O God, for all that Thou hast done for me?
I will bless Thy Holy Name, and serve Thee all the days of my life.
Bless the Lord, O my soul, and let all that is within me bless His Holy Name.
Amen.
